Package: myrpc-server
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.17)
Maintainer: myRPC project <myrpc@example.org>
Description: myRPC remote command execution server
 Daemon that receives bash commands over a stream or datagram socket,
 checks the sender against the list of the allowed users and executes
 the command, returning its output to myRPC-client.
 .
 Every connection is served in a separate process.  The configuration is
 read from /etc/myRPC/myRPC.conf and reloaded on SIGHUP.
